{"headword":"中","reading":"なか","gloss_ja":"物の内側。範囲の内部。","gloss_zh":"裡面、中間。","source":"curated","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"}
{"headword":"九","reading":"きゅう","gloss_ja":"数の九。","gloss_zh":"九。","source":"curated","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"}
