{"headword":"今日","reading":"きょう","gloss_ja":"今の日。","gloss_zh":"今天。","source":"curated","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"}
{"headword":"体","reading":"からだ","gloss_ja":"人や動物の全体。健康状態のことにも使う。","gloss_zh":"身體。","source":"curated","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"}
